#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:191
msgid ""
"<qt>Sets the number of recent files remembered by Kate."
"<p><strong>NOTE: </strong>If you set this lower than the current value, the "
"list will be truncated and some items forgotten.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Leggt de Tall vun annerlest opmaakte Dateien fast, de Kate sik markt. "
"<p><strong>Mark op: </strong>Wenn du dissen Weert daalsettst, ward de List "
"afsnedt, wat bedüüdt dat en Reeg Indrääg vergeten warrt.</qt>"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:200
msgid "Allow Kate to use more than one UN&IX process"
msgstr "Kate verlöven, mehr as een Unix-&Perzess to bruken"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:204
msgid ""
"If this is unchecked, Kate will only use one UNIX process. If you try "
"running it again, the current process will get the focus, and open any files "
"you requested to be opened. If it is checked, each time you start Kate, a "
"new UNIX process will be started."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dat nich aktiveert is, ward Kate bloots een Unix-Perzess bruken. Wenn "
"du denn versöchst, dat'n tweet maal to starten, ward de al aktive Perzess "
"den Fokus kriegen un de Dateien opmaken, de du to't Opmaken angeven hest. "
"Wenn't aktiveert is, ward jümmers en nieg Perzess start, wenn Kate start "
"ward."

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:211
msgid "Sync &terminal emulator with active document"
msgstr "De Padd in'n &Terminalemulator mit den Padd vun't aktive Dokment liek maken"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:214
msgid ""
"If this is checked, the built in Konsole will <code>cd</code> to the "
"directory of the active document when started and whenever the active "
"document changes, if the document is a local file."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dat aktiveert is, ward de inbuut Konsool mit <code>cd</code> to den "
"Orner vun't aktive Dokment wesseln, un twoors jümmers bi't starten un "
"wenn't ännert ward (wenn't en lokaal Datei is)."

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:221
