#, no-c-format
msgid "&Project"
msgstr "&Projekt"

#: rc.cpp:8
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Document"
msgstr "&Dokment"

#: tips.cpp:3
msgid ""
"<p>Kate comes with a nice set of plugins, providing simple\n"
"and advanced features of all sorts.</p>\n"
"<p>You can enable/disable plugins to suit your needs in the configuration "
"dialog,\n"
"choose <strong>Settings -&gt;configure</strong> to launch that.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Kate ward mit'n groot Sett vun Plugins levert, de eenfache\n"
"un verwiederte Funktschonen vun all Sorten praatstellen.</p>\n"
"<p>De Plugins köönt all to dien Pläseer in den Instellen-Dialoog\n"
" aktiveert un utschalt warrn.\n"
"Gah na <strong>Instellen -&gt;Kate instellen</strong>, üm dorhen to "
"kamen.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:10
msgid ""
"<p>You can swap the characters on each side of the cursor just by pressing\n"
"<strong>Ctrl+T</strong></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>De Teken op beed Sieden vun'n Cursor köönt eenfach tuuscht warrn:\n"
"<strong>STRG+T</strong> drücken.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:15
msgid ""
"<p>You can export the current document as a HTML file, including\n"
"syntax highlighting.</p>\n"
"<p>Just choose <strong>File -&gt; Export -&gt; HTML...</strong></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Du kannst dat aktive Dokment as'n HTML-Datei spiekern, ok Syntaxmarkeren "
"blifft sichtbor.</p>\n"
"<p>Gah eenfach na <strong>Datei -&gt;Exporteren -&gt; HTML...</strong></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:21
msgid ""
"<p>You can split the Kate editor as many times as you like and\n"
"in either direction. Each frame has its own status bar and\n"
"can display any open document.</p>\n"
"<p>Just choose "
"<br><strong>View -&gt; Split [ Horizontal | Vertical ]</strong></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Du kannst den Kate-Editor so faken delen as du wullt, un in\n"
"all Richten. All Ansichten hebbt se ehr egen Statusbalken un köönt\n"
"all opmaakte Dokmenten wiesen.</p>\n"
"<p>Gah eenfach na "
"<br><strong>Ansicht -&gt;[ Pielliek | Waagrecht ] Delen </strong></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:28
msgid ""
"<p>You can drag the Tool views (<em>File List</em> and <em>File "
"Selector</em>)\n"
"to any side that you want them in Kate, or stack them, or even tear them off "
"the\n"
"main window.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Du kannst de Warktüüchansichten (<em>Dateilist</em> un "
"<em>Dateigrieper</em>)\n"
"to jichtenseen Siet trecken, wor du se hebben wullt, oder ok övernanner "
"stapeln,\n"
"oder sogor vun't Hööftfinster losrieten</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:34
msgid ""
"<p>Kate has a build in terminal emulator, just press <strong>F7</strong> to\n"
"show or hide it as you desire.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Kate hett en inbuut Terminalemulator, eenfach <strong>F7</strong> "
"drücken,\n"
"üm em to wiesen oder to versteken, jüst as du magst.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:39
msgid ""
"<p>Kate can highlight the current line with a \n"
"<table bgcolor=\"yellow\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" "
"width=\"100%\"><tr><td>different \n"
"background color.<strong>|</strong></td></tr></table></p>\n"
"<p>You can set the color in the <em>Colors</em> page of the configuration \n"
"dialog.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Kate kann de aktuelle Reeg \n"
"<table bgcolor=\"yellow\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" "
"width=\"100%\">mit'n annere \n"
"Achtergrundklöör markeren.<strong>|</strong></td></tr></table></p>\n"
"<p>Du kannst de Klöör in de <em>Klören</em>-Siet vun den\n"
"Instellen-Dialoog fastleggen.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:47
msgid ""
"<p>You can open the currently edited file in any other application from "
"within \n"
"Kate.</p>\n"
"<p>Choose <strong>File -&gt; Open With</strong> for the list of programs \n"
"configured\n"
"for the document type. There is also an option <strong>Other...</strong> to "
"\n"
"choose any application on your system.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Du kannst dat aktive Dokment vun Kate ut in all annere\n"
"Programmen opmaken.</p>\n"
"<p>Gah na <strong>Datei -&gt; Opmaken mit</strong>. Dor ward\n"
"en List vun Programmen för den aktiven Dokment-Typ wiest.\n"
"Dor gifft dat ok en Optschoon <strong>Annere...</strong>, mit de\n"
"all Programmen op dien Systeem utwählt warrn köönt.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:56
msgid ""
"<p>You can configure the editor to always display the line numbers and/or \n"
"bookmark panes when started from the <strong>View Defaults</strong> page of "
"the\n"
"configuration dialog.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Du kannst den Editor so instellen, dat jümmers de Nummern vun de\n"
"Regen un/oder de Leesteken wiest warrt. De Instellen finnst Du op de\n"
"<strong>Standardansicht</strong>-Siet vun den Instellen-Dialoog.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:62
msgid ""
"<p>You can download new or updated <em>Syntax highlight definitions</em> "
"from \n"
"the <strong>Highlighting</strong> page in the configuration dialog.</p>\n"
"<p>Just click the <em>Download...</em> button on the <em>Highlight "
"Modes</em>\n"
"tab (You have to be online, of course...).</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Du kannst niege oder opdateerte <strong>Syntaxmarkeren-Regeln</strong> "
"daalladen,\n"
"dat finnst Du op de <strong>Syntaxmarkeren</strong>-Siet vun den "
"Instellen-Dialoog.</p>\n"
"<p>Eenfach op den <em>Daalladen...</em>-Knoop op dat "
"<em>Markeernsoorden</em>-Paneel klicken.\n"
"(Du muttst natürlich in't Nett könen...)</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:69
msgid ""
"<p>You can cycle through all open documents by pressing "
"<strong>Alt+Left</strong> \n"
"or <strong>Alt+Right</strong>. The next/previous document will immediately "
"be displayed \n"
"in the active frame.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Du kannst dör all apen Dokmenten gahn, wenn Du\n"
"<strong>ALT+Links</strong> oder <strong>ALT+Rechts</strong> drückst.Dat "
"tokamen / vörige Dokment ward denn in den aktiven Rahmen wiest.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:75
msgid ""
"<p>You can do cool sed-like regular expression replacements using "
"<em>Editing \n"
"Command</em>.</p>\n"
"<p>For example, press <strong>Ctrl+M</strong> and enter "
"<code>s/oldtext/newtext/g</code> \n"
"to replace &quot;oldtext&quot; with &quot;newtext&quot; throughout the "
"current \n"
"line.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Du kannst vigeliensche Utwesseln as mit 'sed' maken, wenn Du\n"
"<em>Bewerken-Befehlen</em> bruukst.</p>\n"
"<p>As'n Bispeel drück <strong>STRG+M</strong> un giff "
"<code>s/OolText/NiegText/g<code> in,\n"
"denn ward överall in de Reeg &quot;NiegText&quot; ansteed vun "
"&quot;OolText&quot; insett.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:83
msgid ""
"<p>You can repeat your last search by just pressing <strong>F3</strong>, or "
"\n"
"<strong>Shift+F3</strong> if you want to search backwards.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Du kannst de leste Söök mit <strong>F3</strong> eenfach wedderhalen.\n"
"Wenn Du na Achtern söken wullt, drück eenfach "
"<strong>Ümschalt+F3</strong>.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:88
msgid ""
"<p>You can filter the files displayed in the <em>File Selector</em> tool "
"view. \n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Simply enter your filter in the filter entry at the bottom, for example: "
"\n"
"<code>*.html *.php</code> if you only want to see HTML and PHP files in the "
"\n"
"current folder.</p>\n"
"<p>The File Selector will even remember your filters for you.</strong></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Du kannst de Dateien, de in den <em>Dateigrieper</em> wiest warrn,\n"
"utfiltern.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Giff eenfach Dien Filter in dat Filterfeld nerrn in, t.B.:\n"
"\n"
"<code>*.html *.php</code>, wenn Du bloots HTML- un PHP-Dateien binnen\n"
"den aktiven Orner ankieken wullt.</p>\n"
"<p>De Dateigrieper ward sogor Diene Filters för Di behollen.</strong></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:97
msgid ""
"<p>You can have two views - or even more - of the same document in Kate. "
"Editing \n"
"in either will be reflected in both.</p>\n"
"<p>So if you find yourself scrolling up and down to look at text at the "
"other \n"
"end of a document, just press <strong>Ctrl+Shift+T</strong> to split \n"
"horizontally.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Du kannst twee oder ok mehr Ansichten vun dat sülve Dokment in Kate "
"hebben.\n"
"Ännern in de een ward ok binnen de annere wiest.</p>\n"
"<p>Wenn Du also markst, dat hooch- un daalrullst, üm Text an't annere Enn\n"
"vun't Dokment antokieken, drück eenfach <strong>STRG+Ümschalt+T</strong>,\n"
"denn ward de Ansicht waagrecht opdeelt.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:105
msgid ""
"<p>Press <strong>F8</strong> or <strong>Shift+F8</strong> to switch to the \n"
"next/previous frame.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Drück <strong>F8</strong> oder <strong>Ümschalt+F8</strong>, üm\n"
"to den tokamen/vörigen Rahmen to wesseln.</p>\n"
